# Build output and local state
dist
coverage
.wrangler
node_modules

# Generated by the impeccable hook, not hand-edited
.impeccable

# Vendored from the shadcn registry and overwritten by `shadcn add`. Formatting
# them would be undone on the next regeneration — and worse, `format:check`
# would start failing the moment anyone re-added a component. eslint.config.js
# carves the same directory out for the same reason.
src/components/ui

# Lockfile — bun owns the formatting
bun.lock

# Prose stays hand-set. Prettier's only substantive change to the markdown in
# this repo is rewriting `*emphasis*` as `_emphasis_` — there is no option to
# turn that off, and CLAUDE.md, DESIGN.md, PRODUCT.md and CONTEXT.md are
# long-form documents whose source is meant to be read as well as rendered.
# `proseWrap` is left at "preserve" for the same reason, so nothing is gained by
# including them and five carefully written files get churned.
*.md

